<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Profil non trouvé - NFC Card</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e3f2fd 0%, #90caf9 100%);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .error-container {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      max-width: 500px;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 60px 40px;
      text-align: center;
      animation: fadeIn 0.6s ease-out;
    }
    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(30px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }
    .error-icon {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      margin: 0 auto 30px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #42a5f5 0%, #1e88e5 100%);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(66, 165, 245, 0.3);
    }
    .error-icon i {
      font-size: 60px;
      color: white;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #333;
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    .error-code {
      color: #42a5f5;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    p {
      color: #666;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .reasons {
      background: #f5f5f5;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .reasons h3 {
      color: #333;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .reasons ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .reasons li {
      color: #666;
      font-size: 14px;
      padding: 8px 0;
      padding-left: 25px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .reasons li:before {
      content: "•";
      color: #42a5f5;
      font-weight: bold;
      position: absolute;
      left: 10px;
    }
    .home-link {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 30px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #42a5f5 0%, #1e88e5 100%);
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 25px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: all 0.3s;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(66, 165, 245, 0.3);
    }
    .home-link:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(66, 165, 245, 0.4);
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding-top: 20px;
      border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
      color: #999;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="error-container">
    <div class="error-icon">
      <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i>
    </div>
    
    <h1>Profil non trouvé</h1>
    <div class="error-code">Erreur 404</div>
    
    <p>Désolé, nous n'avons pas pu trouver le profil que vous recherchez.</p>
    
    <div class="reasons">
      <h3>Raisons possibles :</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Le lien est incorrect ou a expiré</li>
        <li>La carte NFC a été désactivée</li>
        <li>Le profil a été supprimé</li>
        <li>L'URL contient une erreur de frappe</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
      NFC Card Manager
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
